cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or build on our findings, please cite the paper below.
title: IndexRAG
abstract: >-
  Index-time reasoning for multi-hop retrieval-augmented generation. Bridging
  facts are generated during offline indexing so that cross-document inferences
  become directly retrievable, leaving a single retrieval pass and a single LLM
  call at inference time.
type: software
